Version 0.7.1

-------------

(mab) Add BASIC Functions / Statements:

      SDENCRYPT / SDDECRYPT

SDEXT – Generic function for extending SD / BASIC to interface with C Functions.

      Remove unsupported BASIC Functions / Statements:

         ABORTE, ABORTM

         CONNECT.PORT, ERRMSG, TTYGET, TTYSET, STOPE, STOPM

